#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0468 expect=skipped domain=ADSL
#note "STRATAR is not declared. No wildcards on this rule, so there is no expansion: RuleRunner applies Requirements.Variables.All ['STRATAR'] directly, finds the column absent and reports the rule as not executed with that reason. Without the All entry the rule would merely be silent (absent target -> EC-53 empty BitSet); the All entry is what turns that silence into an auditable skip."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col STRATARN type=Num
---
S1 | 001 | 1
S1 | 002 | 2
